{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_026_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80921d109ec3c58de1aa65aa6f18f9043bc53f700e0fcaddbbc6a0fe9dac491d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fcb45a18aefba5930e75be9a7c0650ba1c3bf185a53bdc85dd03edc56194056",
      "text": "这边的卖场是益智玩具吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48400f40d54571d8c5633b35466a7b5d102fdd5ad3aadc2e6190cf22375f8a0c",
      "text": "玄武先生，请看这个。\n有个看起来很有趣的玩具哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5c0f025c29f6bb44c0a41ae8b618feb74eb2c0e26fb7f6c29af687c645ebd0d",
      "text": "能学习编程的玩具吗。\n现在还有这种东西啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a934be353d728ea6a0087e5e05931b5f4ddf596001eb50a358913c61a44c2ac0",
      "text": "百闻不如一见，试着玩一下吧。\n……把这个这样弄……摆弄这个电路吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17eb3febfa89bba41ea8b3a9a2a21653b5293b3fbf73341fff88a8fe3610a522",
      "text": "应该……是这边的电路吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63a8219ee47b761c591d769fea512995bb43e08393834eede02ef23b9d3814fc",
      "text": "原来是这么回事啊。这样一来这里就接通了……\n嘿。挺有意思的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fb7509c53931a502072cd7b7f9dba932b915237e430def263f8e405a9416dad",
      "text": "这个很棒呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ba8ff7bee7346b8bfb1c6ac290400f96f51cb105f5ee197c28fbc1706137dbd",
      "text": "嗯，这个也买回去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3832f45cee2942a07f92b185cde4ed7d4b99998347ce6fba05749ea1fdaa656c",
      "text": "啊，玄武先生。这个怎么样？是用放进嘴里\n也无害的材质制作的玩具……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aece9e8edf811b0f8def7aa0026f3b5d591a8bfb5300c78dfc4682fe3e5d0c9d",
      "text": "嚯，福利院里也有小娃娃在，挺不错的。\n这个也买了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c06984b95d7ca3e6ddfa096f4ba8034aa488f1ec9c68f33602e5e0a2a48c074",
      "text": "好了，差不多该去结账了。\n多亏了番长，度过了一段很有意义的时光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b561da2b8d19332688eb2a6fd732a877f69a73bcf79b737708e647bd932b01a",
      "text": "番长果然靠得住啊。\n谢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
